---
import GameLayout from '../layouts/GameLayout.astro';
import '../styles/trust-pages.css';
---
<GameLayout title="Privacy Policy | EMFLS Games" description="Read how EMFLS Games handles contact information and the current privacy behavior of its browser-game site." canonical="/privacy/" robots="index, follow" ogType="website">
  <div class="trust-page"><div class="container trust-page__inner">
    <header class="trust-page__header"><p class="trust-page__eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="trust-meta">Last updated: September 24, 2026</p></header>
    <div class="trust-page__content">
      <section class="trust-panel"><h2>Privacy at a glance</h2><ul class="trust-list"><li>No account or registration is required.</li><li>There is no server-side player profile or cloud save.</li><li>There is no leaderboard account or payment profile.</li><li>Contact information is received only when you voluntarily email us.</li></ul></section>
      <section class="trust-section"><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>If you email <a href="mailto:contact@emfls.com">contact@emfls.com</a>, we may process your email address, message contents, and any information you choose to include so we can understand and respond to your message. Please avoid sending information that is not needed for your question.</p></section>
      <section class="trust-section"><h2>Game and account data</h2><p>EMFLS Games does not currently require account registration, maintain a cloud player profile, provide a leaderboard account, or process a payment profile. The game site does not promise preservation of local or session results.</p></section>
      <section class="trust-section"><h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>EMFLS Games does not currently use Google Analytics or display Google AdSense ads on its game pages. If analytics, advertising, browser storage, or another data behavior is added later, this policy should be reviewed and updated before that behavior is part of the public product.</p></section>
      <section class="trust-section"><h2>Hosting and technical delivery</h2><p>The site is delivered through web hosting and infrastructure providers that may process ordinary technical request information needed to deliver and protect the service. This page does not claim a specific retention period for that technical information.</p></section>
      <section class="trust-section"><h2>Privacy questions</h2><p>For a privacy question, email <a href="mailto:contact@emfls.com">contact@emfls.com</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</GameLayout>
